			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Add doc comments across RPC, Environment, and Vine modules\n\nAdd module-level `///` doc comments to every `pub mod` declaration in the\nCocoonService handler suite (Auth, Command, Debug, Extension, FileSystem,\nInitialization, Output, Provider, SCM, Secret, Task, Terminal, TreeView, Window,\nWorkspace — ~40 submodule files) and the remaining RPC services (Commands,\nConfiguration, Debug, EchoAction, Processes, SCM, Telemetry, Terminals, Types,\nVine, Windows, Workspace).\n\nAdd doc comments to Environment submodule declarations (DebugProvider, Feature-\nMethods, Utility, WebviewProvider), the ConfigurationProvider::Loading public\nre-export, and complete the TestProvider documentation pass with field-level\ndocs on TestRun, TestRunStatus, and TestResult structs plus blank-line\nseparators between enum variant docs across all TestProvider types.\n\nReplace `// TODO:` stubs in SecretProvider with structured docs noting the\nplanned Air integration and current NotImplemented return. Add section docs to\nSearchProvider::de_glob_list and UserInterfaceProvider::SendUserInterfaceRequest.\nTighten Vine module docs: replace \"Manages\"/\"Handles\" with \"Forwards\"/\n\"Dispatches\" on notification dispatchers, fix grammar in Client module docs.\n\nNon-docs: disable DevTools web inspector and clear trace logging in Info.plist;\nstrip lint blank lines from bootstrap-fork.js; fix shell-integration redirect\nsyntax; wrap README.md and Architecture.md to consistent 80-column prose.",
